Source scope is one observer/character, at most15 panel frames and17 instants.
Training displays and the character's current protocol attempts are separate;
an attempt is not automatic efficacy evidence. Two fixed adopted action plans
provide the bounded response set, not general affordance discovery or planning.
Severity valuation is governed content, not learned consequence utility. The latest
safe reserve/catalogue context and completed Known affect are carried explicitly;
this is not general memory, decay, physiological affect dynamics or unguided event
segmentation. Unknown factors conservatively make the numeric projection unavailable;
affect under uncertain control remains an important open generalization.
